{"type":"message","id":"add0da07","parentId":"a179c6ab","timestamp":"2026-05-18T04:46:50.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the GET /send endpoint returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". Let me try a POST with different field names.\n\nActually, I got a text response `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2` with GET to /send. The issue is that POST to /send with JSON body returns error 1101.\n\nLet me try with proper JSON and the right endpoint structure.\n\nActually, looking at the API documentation in the task - it says `POST /send`. Let me check if maybe the Content-Type needs to not be application/json. Or maybe the body format is different.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-52f987ec-00b0-43f9-b230-11a8414c59da","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different JSON field names\nfor FIELD in \"content\" \"message\" \"text\" \"body\"; do\n  echo \"=== Testing field: $FIELD ===\"\n  curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n    -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"$FIELD\\\":\\\"heartbeat test\\\"}\" 2>&1\n  echo \"\"\ndone"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":118,"output":261,"cacheRead":18992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19371,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779079596545,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c01c9320-b633-4b8b-81b9-d61656a2e8a6"}}
