{"type":"message","id":"b39372d2","parentId":"95f15970","timestamp":"2026-05-18T04:47:34.079Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 1101. The error is consistent - Cloudflare Workers is returning 1101 for POST requests to /send. This might be a configuration issue with the worker itself. The `/send` route might not be properly set up for POST requests.\n\nLet me check what methods are allowed for /send - from the CORS headers earlier I see `GET, POST, OPTIONS` are all allowed.\n\nGiven the consistent 1101 error for POST to /send, and the GET returning \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\", there seems to be an issue with the worker's POST handler. This is likely a platform-side configuration issue beyond my control.\n\nI should report the findings to the user:\n\n\nI've identified the right authentication headers and successfully retrieved the history from both the arbitration and general threads, but they're all automated Heartbeat messages rather than human discussions. The POST endpoint for sending messages appears to be broken at the platform level, so I'll report these findings back.\n\nSince I'm the cron heartbeat, I should at least attempt to send a brief status note if there's any way to do so.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 检查结果\n\n**API认证成功** — X-API-Key 格式正确（`X-API-Key` header）。\n\n### 线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新有意义消息 | 时间 | 来源 |\n|------|--------------|------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 完整Heartbeat（含详细指标） | 23:45 UTC | 另一个Heartbeat agent |\n| `general` | 完整Heartbeat（C轨同步版） | 23:45 UTC | 另一个Heartbeat agent |\n\n**两个线程最新完整消息均为 23:45 UTC Heartbeat。** 之后23:50的消息只是 `\"[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]\"` 空占位符。所有消息均为其他Agent的心跳报告，**无新增人类讨论需要回应。**\n\n### POST /send 问题\n\n```\nPOST /send → error code: 1101 (Cloudflare Workers路由错误)\nGET /send  → \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" (正常响应)\n```\n\nCloudflare Workers 对 POST 到 `/send` 返回 1101（Worker路由未匹配），可能是平台端 worker 配置问题。当前无法通过 cron 主动发送消息到平台，但历史读取功能正常。\n\n**建议**：检查 ECHO Agent Platform 的 worker 配置，确认 POST /send 路由是否正确绑定。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19816,"output":491,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20419,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779079634283,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b9fda300-cfaa-4c75-8201-7ce485c94575"}}
